            "review_title": "Review at Isushi",
            "review_text": "LPN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam82 contributions\n0\nAll you can eat sushi and sashimi and other dishes\nJun 2019 • Solo\nI first tried this restaurant in Hanoi and was impressed and then delighted to discover that it has a Saigon location.\n\nI was craving sushi so I absolutely pigged out at this restaurant. They offer all you can eat options. I chose the 369k option and ate for over an hour. I must have ordered at least 10 courses. Well worth the money as I was pretty much in a food coma. \n\nIf you want a good bang for your buck for basic sushi, sashimi, and fried and grilled dishes, go here. If you want fancy rolls, there are two other sushi places across the street. \n\nAbsolutely recommend this place.\nRead more\nWritten June 13, 2019",
